By design. See ?":=" and ?copy.

If table1 is 20GB in RAM, you need to be explicit to tell data.table you
really really want to copy it; i.e., table2=copy(table1).

It deliberately breaks standard R practice. Which is partly why it's a new
operator that works differently.

