From mdowle at mdowle.plus.com  Tue Oct  9 00:06:21 2012
From: mdowle at mdowle.plus.com (Matthew Dowle)
Date: Mon, 8 Oct 2012 23:06:21 +0100
Subject: [datatable-help] svSocket+data.table
